  "details": "1. Open the Debug UI.\n\n2. Enable the `Show VRC_UiShapes` Option in the Version & Info section.\n\n3. Open the Big Menu Settings page.\n\n4. In Graphics > Basic, Increase the Vertical Field of View.\n\n5. Notice the Debug Info at the top of the screen.\n\n6. Reset the Vertical Field of View to the default with the reset button.\n\n7. Notice the Debug Info is cropped outside of the screen.\n\nThe VRC_UiShapes Debug Info is not visible at the default field of view.",
